<title>USA: Amerihost Properties Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Amerihost Properties Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.01			nil</p>
<p> Net			    136			 14</p>
<p> Revs			16,571		   11,992</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,638		    6,332</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: EBITDA $2.2 million vs $1.7 million  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.50		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			  3,395		    2,138</p>
<p> Revs			68,342		   51,962</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,692		    6,125</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: EBITDA $12.9 million vs $8.9 million.</p>
<p>1996 year results include non-recurring gain of about $535,000 or $0.05/shr from sale of excess land and one hotel and expenses of about $238,000, after taxes, from a public offering of common stock that was not consummated.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
